  "description": "A comprehensive .NET configuration management library that extends Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration with enhanced features. Supports hierarchical settings, environment-specific configurations, strongly-typed options, validation, and live reloading. Includes unified access to multiple configuration sources (JSON files, environment variables, command line) with built-in development/production environment awareness for .NET 9 applications.",
